# Placeholder to make `workspace_seed/` tracked by git.
#
# Prime Agent doesn't yet need any workspace seed files, but the Dockerfile's
# `COPY workspace_seed /opt/lift/workspace_seed` (see agent-runtimes/prime_agent/Dockerfile)
# needs the source directory to exist at build time. Empty directories are not
# tracked by git; without this file, a fresh clone would fail to build.
#
# When real seed files (e.g. AGENTS.md, project context) get added here, this
# .gitkeep can be removed. LIFT resolves this dir via PRIME_AGENT_WORKSPACE_SEED_DIR
# (src/paths.py).
